&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Card:&lt;/b&gt; {!Cards.cardDefinitionDeveloperName}&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Environment:&lt;/b&gt; {!Cards.businessEnvType}&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Usage model:&lt;/b&gt; {!Cards.usageModel}&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Consumed:&lt;/b&gt; {!Cards.unitsConsumed} of {!Cards.totalEntitlement}&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Threshold crossed:&lt;/b&gt; {!Thresholds}&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review the balance in Setup under Digital Wallet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Sent by the WSM - Digital Wallet Alerts flow. To change who receives this email or which levels trigger it, open the WSM Agentforce Tools tab and edit the Digital Wallet Alerts settings.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
